{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1436799-w20-enhancing-the-pack-optimal-initial-char-gen-pack","id":1436799,"title":"W20 Enhancing the Pack / Optimal initial char gen pack.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-02-24T07:22:48-08:00","id":1436799,"title":"W20 Enhancing the Pack / Optimal initial char gen pack.","content":"Greetings,<br /> <br /> Reviewing the list of Gifts/Rites/Backgrounds/Merits in Apocalypse, no many of them actually enhance the pack capabilities:<ul><li>Pack tactics: <i>Pack Tactics</i>, <i>Unity of the Pack</i>.</li> <li>Battlefield control: <i>Jam Weapon, Calm, Dazzle</i>.</li> <li>Post-battle care: <i>Mother</i>\u2019<i>s Touch, Grandmother</i>\u2019<i>s Touch, Calm the Savage Beast</i>, <i>Lover</i><i>s Touch</i>.</li> <li>Pack support: <i>Inspiration, </i><i>Pledge of the Battle Mate, Rite of the Loyal Pack</i>, <i>Natural Leader, Supporter</i>.</li> <li>Resources (preferably at 5 to buy stuff for the Pack), Totem (specially Rorg).</li> <li>Have a dedicated Fetish-crafter / Ritemaster.</li> <li>Use a Sept totem (Benefits without ban? Yes please)</li> </ul>The most team-focused tribe is the Children of Gaia, with most of the support gifts, some of the best combat gifts (<i>Jam Weapon, Resist Pain, Calm, Luna\u2019s Armor, Dazzle</i>), plus a creed that encourages cooperation.<br /> <br /> <b>What is the optimal minimal starter pack?</b> Something to face all challenges. I was thinking of these guys (including <i>Wolverine</i> as a Sept Totem), and * for shared Backgrounds:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_description\">Code:</div> <pre class=\"bbcode_code notranslate\" style=\"max-height:calc(30 * 1.4rem + 2 * var(--bbcode-padding) + var(--h-scrollbar-allowance));\">Breed: Metis Auspice: Ahroun Tribe: Children of Gaia Nature: Competitor Demeanor: Soldier Rank: 1 Physical: Strength 4 (6/8/7/5) (Claws), Dexterity 7 (7/8/9/9) (Dodging), Stamina 2 (4/5/5/4) Social: Charisma 4 (Air of Confidence), Manipulation 1 (0/0/0/0), Appearance 0 (0/0/0/0) Mental: Perception 2, Intelligence 1, Wits 5 (Combat Reflexes) Talents: Alertness 3, Athletics 3, Brawl 3, Intimidation 1, Primal-Urge 3 Skills: Etiquette 1, Stealth 3, Survival 1 Knowledges: Academics 1, Enigmas 3, Investigation 1, Law 1, Medicine 1, Occult 1, Rituals 1 Backgrounds: Fetish 3 (Hunter\u2019s Talons), Rites 1, Totem 1 (Hummingbird) Rage: 6 Gnosis: 5 Willpower: 10 Glory: 2 Honor: 1 Wisdom: 0 Metis deformity: Eyes of Darkness, Tough Hide Gifts: (1) Jam Weapon, Razor Claws, Sense Wyrm; (2) Spirit of the Fray Rites: Rite of Contrition Merits: Acute Sense 3 (Hearing, Sight, Smell), Concentration, Lucky, Self-Confident Flaws: Double Jeopardy, Monstrous, Nightmares Breed: Lupus Auspice: Galliard Tribe: Stargazers Nature: Guru Demeanor: Pedagogue Rank: 1 Physical: Strength 1 (3/5/4/2), Dexterity 6 (6/7/8/8) (Dodging), Stamina 2 (4/5/5/4) Social: Charisma 5 (Commanding Voice), Manipulation 2 (0/0/0/0), Appearance 1 (0/0/1/1) Mental: Perception 1, Intelligence 5 (Learning), Wits 4 (Combat Reflexes) Talents: Alertness 3, Empathy 3, Primal-Urge 3 Skills: Performance 1, Stealth 1, Survival 3 Knowledges: Enigmas 3, Investigation 1, Medicine 3, Occult 3, Rituals 3 Backgrounds: Rites 5, Totem 1 (Hummingbird) Rage: 5 Gnosis: 5 Willpower: 10 Glory: 2 Honor: 0 Wisdom: 1 Gifts: (1) Canine Call, Channeling, Hare\u2019s Leap Rites: Rite of Binding, Rite of Talisman Dedication, Rite of the Fetish Merits: Concentration, Friend of Sorcery, Mother\u2019s Insight, Self-Confident Flaws: Foul Temper, Mark of the Predator, Strict Carnivore, Vengeful (Vampires) Breed: Metis Auspice: Philodox Tribe: Uktena Nature: Conformist Demeanor: Visionary Rank: 1 Physical: Strength 1 (3/5/4/2), Dexterity 7 (7/8/9/9) (Dodging), Stamina 3 (5/6/6/5) Social: Charisma 4 (Commanding), Manipulation 1 (0/0/0/0), Appearance 0 (0/0/0/0) Mental: Perception 5 (Sharp Senses), Intelligence 1, Wits 4 (Combat Reflexes) Talents: Alertness 3, Athletics 3, Brawl 1, Empathy 3, Primal-Urge 3 Skills: Animal Ken 1, Stealth 1, Survival 3 Knowledges: Enigmas 3, Occult 3, Rituals 3 Backgrounds: Fetish 2 (Uktena Scale), Rites 2, Totem 1 (Hummingbird) Rage: 4 Gnosis: 3 Willpower: 10 (Using a Medicine Bag talisman) Glory: 0 Honor: 3 Wisdom: 0 Metis deformity: Eyes of Darkness Gifts: (1) Scent of the True Form, Sense Magic, Sense Wyrm Rites: Rite of Summoning Merits: Acute Sense 3 (Hearing, Sight, Smell), Concentration, Eidetic Memory, Good Instincts, Inner Sight, Self-Confident Flaws: Hunted, Monstrous Breed: Homid Auspice: Theurge Tribe: Glass Walkers Nature: Scientist Demeanor: Trickster Rank: 1 Physical: Strength 1 (3/5/4/2), Dexterity 6 (6/7/8/8) (Dodging), Stamina 2 (4/5/5/4) Social: Charisma 5 (Charming), Manipulation 2 (0/0/0/0), Appearance 1 (0/0/1/1) Mental: Perception 1, Intelligence 4 (Calculations), Wits 5 (Shrewd) Talents: Alertness 1, Empathy 3, Streetwise 1 Skills: Crafts 3, Drive 3, Firearms 3 Knowledges: Computer 3, Investigation 1, Rituals 3, Science 3, Technology 3 Backgrounds: Resources 5, Rites 1, Totem 2 (Hummingbird) Rage: 3 Gnosis: 1 Willpower: 10 Glory: 0 Honor: 0 Wisdom: 3 Gifts: (1) Apecraft\u2019s Blessings, Plug and Play, Spirit Speech Rites: Rite of the Questing Stone Merits: Acute Sense 1 (Sight), Computer Aptitude, Concentration, Eidetic Memory, Lightning Calculator, Mechanical Aptitude, Self-Confident Flaws: Foul Temper, Impatient, Persistent Parents, Short Fuse Breed: Homid Auspice: Ragabash Tribe: Fianna Nature: Alpha Demeanor: Director Rank: 1 Physical: Strength 1 (3/5/4/2), Dexterity 6 (6/7/8/8) (Dodging), Stamina 2 (4/5/5/4) Social: Charisma 5 (Leadership), Manipulation 4 (2/0/0/0) (Reverse Psychology), Appearance 1 (0/0/1/1) Mental: Perception 5 (Detail-Oriented), Intelligence 1, Wits 2 Talents: Empathy 